     "text": "He will not.",
     "start": 1315.039,
     "end": 1316.468
    },
    {
     "segment": "sleep-philippians-4",
     "text": "Be careful for nothing;",
     "start": 1317.848,
     "end": 1319.811
    },
    {
     "segment": "sleep-philippians-4",
     "text": "but in every thing by prayer and supplication with thanksgiving let your requests be made known unto God.",
     "start": 1319.991,
     "end": 1327.436
    },
    {
     "segment": "sleep-philippians-4",
     "text": "And the peace of God, which passeth all understanding, shall keep your hearts and minds through Christ Jesus.",
     "start": 1327.616,
     "end": 1335.616
    },
    {
     "segment": "sleep-reflect-phil",
     "text": "The peace of God shall keep your heart and mind, like a guard at the door.",
     "start": 1336.996,
     "end": 1342.479
    },
    {
     "segment": "sleep-reflect-phil",
     "text": "Whatever news tomorrow brings, tonight that peace stands watch over you.",
